{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：16:19 2026-11-15 HKT<br/>發佈時間：16:19 2026-11-15 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：16:19 2026-11-15 HKT</p><img alt=\"男司機清醒被送往屯門醫院治理。資料圖片\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/81aedde625bd95f264251db2be4a3081/2026-11/ha_tuen_2.jpg\"/><p>今日（15日）早上10時許，一輛輕型貨車沿港深西部公路往內地方向行駛，至近新圍污水處理廠對開時撞向防撞欄。救援人員接報到場，發現37歲姓吳男司機身上有酒氣，經初步調查，他未能通過酒精呼氣測試，涉嫌酒後駕駛被捕。吳男其後清醒被送往屯門醫院治理。</p><p></p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-15T08:37:48.023841+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":204,"images":1,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-15T08:19:53+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-15T14:15:54.154591+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-15T08:31:44.318382+00:00","content_hash":"579cfc116a451e302b64e3dc33a4825f3ae8860a49ef527d2a8c690e21c0a406","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}